From 10a38c05683cbbf0a0e3a763e21da17d5bb20934 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: indieindie7 <lonisquasar@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 18:21:34 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] U2Shaders: lightprobe (U2Shaders\lightprobe.req -> two
 frames of light/draw events, vertex layouts, normals)

For the Unreal II bug where a character turns black when a shadow is cast
from a real light. Diagnostic only; nothing changes unless the request file
appears.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
